flowchart TB
accTitle: Two coordinated maintenance workflows
accDescr: Snapshot scheduling brackets the snapshot point with tested database scripts. Patching follows a separate cluster-aware maintenance sequence. The database team validates both procedures.
D[Validated EC2 RAC design]:::inputData --> B[DLM backup schedule]:::decision
D --> P[SSM maintenance window]:::decision
B --> F[Pre-script<br/>Quiesce and flush]:::output
F --> S[(EBS snapshot point)]:::storage
S --> U[Post-script<br/>Resume database writes]:::output
P --> N[Drain eligible node<br/>Patch and reboot safely]:::output
N --> H{Cluster healthy?}:::decision
H -->|Yes| NEXT[Proceed to next node]:::output
H -->|No| STOP[Stop and investigate]:::warning
